{"name":"标签页","description":"标签页是在同一页面内切换平级内容面板的导航组件 · 项目详情可在“概览、配置、日志”之间切换。要清楚显示当前标签和是否保留输入状态；本质为不同页面的内容应使用导航菜单。","quote":"内容太多了，帮我分几个页签，点一下就换一屏。","agentPrompt":"在项目详情中用页签切换“概览、成员、日志”，始终标出当前页签。请保留各页签合理的状态，并验证鼠标、键盘切换以及小屏下不会被裁掉。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-tabs\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>标签页<span>Tabs</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">内容太多了，帮我分几个页签，点一下就换一屏。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">标签页是在同一页面内切换平级内容面板的导航组件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>项目详情可在“概览、配置、日志”之间切换。要清楚显示当前标签和是否保留输入状态；本质为不同页面的内容应使用导航菜单。</span></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"demo-tabs-wrap\"><div class=\"demo-tabs\"><button class=\"tab active\" data-panel=\"全部 24 个项目\">全部</button><button class=\"tab\" data-panel=\"进行中 6 个项目\">进行中</button><button class=\"tab\" data-panel=\"已完成 18 个项目\">已完成</button></div><div class=\"tabs-panel\">全部 24 个项目</div></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>在项目详情中用页签切换“概览、成员、日志”，始终标出当前页签。请保留各页签合理的状态，并验证鼠标、键盘切换以及小屏下不会被裁掉。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">同一页面切换<b>几组平级内容</b>：全部 / 进行中 / 已完成</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-tabs\"><span class=\"mk-tab on\">全部</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">待付款</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">已完成</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>详情页内容分块</b>：概览、配置、日志，不用来回跳页</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-tabs\"><span class=\"mk-tab \">概览</span><span class=\"mk-tab on\">配置</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">日志</span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">平级内容较少，且用户会频繁来回查看</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-tabs\"><span class=\"mk-tab on\">评论</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">历史</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">收藏</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">不用跳转，点一下就换内容</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">标签文案<b>简短直接</b>，便于快速扫读</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-tabs\"><span class=\"mk-tab on\">全部</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">进行</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">完成</span></div></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">内容有明确先后顺序时，使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"steps\" aria-label=\"步骤条 Steps\">步骤条 <b>Steps</b></a> 更合适</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-steps\"><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>1</i>填写信息</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step on\"><i>2</i>确认订单</span><span class=\"mk-step-bar\"></span><span class=\"mk-step \"><i>3</i>完成支付</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">标签过多且无法在可用宽度内清楚显示时，应改用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/menu?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"menu\" aria-label=\"导航菜单 Menu\">导航菜单 <b>Menu</b></a> 或 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"select\" aria-label=\"选择器 Select\">选择器 <b>Select</b></a></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-tabs\" style=\"overflow:hidden\"><span class=\"mk-tab on\">全部</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">前端</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">后端</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">设计</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">运营</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">产品</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">测试</span><span class=\"mk-tab\">数据</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">放不下的标签会被挤没</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">两组内容需要<b>左右对照</b> → 并排展示，别藏进标签</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch\">\n      <div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"mk-win\" style=\"flex:1\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">左右分栏，两边同时对照</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">标签里放着<b>未保存的表单</b>，一切换内容就丢</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-tabs\"><span class=\"mk-tab on\">基本信息</span><span class=\"mk-tab \">高级设置</span></div><span class=\"mk-input \">还没保存的内容…</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">切走标签，填的内容没了</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><span class=\"tabs-anat\"><span class=\"tabs-anat-bar\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"tab\"><span class=\"tabs-anat-tab\">全部</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"active\"><span class=\"tabs-anat-tab on\">进行中</span></span><span class=\"tabs-anat-tab\">已完成</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"panel\"><span class=\"tabs-anat-panel\">进行中的 6 个项目…</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">标签页</span><span class=\"pe\">Tabs</span></button><span class=\"pd\">整组标签 + 面板的容器</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"tab\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">标签项</span><span class=\"pe\">Tab</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可点击切换，文案要短</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"active\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">当前标签</span><span class=\"pe\">Active Tab</span></button><span class=\"pd\">高亮 + 下划线，告诉用户现在在哪</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"panel\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">内容面板</span><span class=\"pe\">Tab Panel</span></button><span class=\"pd\">当前标签对应的内容区</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">线条型<span>Line</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><div class=\"demo-tabs-wrap\"><div class=\"demo-tabs\"><button class=\"tab active\" data-panel=\"全部 24 个项目\">全部</button><button class=\"tab\" data-panel=\"进行中 6 个项目\">进行中</button><button class=\"tab\" data-panel=\"已完成 18 个项目\">已完成</button></div><div class=\"tabs-panel\">全部 24 个项目</div></div></div><div class=\"variant-when\">默认款，下划线轻，不抢内容风头</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">卡片型<span>Card</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"tabs-v-card\"><i class=\"on\">全部</i><i>进行中</i><i>已完成</i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">想让标签分组感更强、更像独立区块</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">胶囊型<span>Capsule</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"tabs-v-pill\"><i class=\"on\">全部</i><i>进行中</i><i>已完成</i></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">放在工具栏等小空间，更轻巧</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">列表状态筛选</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\"><button class=\"tab active\">全部 24</button><button class=\"tab\">进行中 6</button><button class=\"tab\">已完成 18</button></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">官网首页改版</span><span class=\"demo-tag blue\">进行中</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">设计规范文档</span><span class=\"demo-tag green\">已完成</span></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 2px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">移动端适配</span><span class=\"demo-tag gray\">未开始</span></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">设置页分块</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:420px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">设置</div>\n      <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\"><button class=\"tab active\">账号</button><button class=\"tab\">通知</button><button class=\"tab\">隐私</button></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 2px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-light)\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/avatar-fox.png\" style=\"width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">林小hu</span><button class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"padding:2px 6px;font-size:12px\">更换头像</button></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 2px\"><span style=\"font-size:13px;flex:1\">绑定邮箱</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">you@example.com</span></div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">详情页 概览 / 配置 / 日志</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:8px\"><b style=\"font-size:14px;flex:1\">vibe-ui-guide</b><span class=\"demo-tag green\">运行中</span></div>\n      <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\"><button class=\"tab\">概览</button><button class=\"tab\">配置</button><button class=\"tab active\">日志</button></div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px;background:#1d2129;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:#a9b0bd\">\n        <div><span style=\"color:#86909c\">14:32:05</span> build completed in 3.2s</div>\n        <div><span style=\"color:#86909c\">14:32:06</span> deploying to production…</div>\n        <div style=\"color:#7ee2a8\"><span style=\"color:#86909c\">14:32:09</span> ✓ deploy success</div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">仪表盘视角切换</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto\">\n      <div class=\"demo-tabs\" style=\"max-width:none\"><button class=\"tab active\">本周</button><button class=\"tab\">本月</button><button class=\"tab\">本季度</button></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px\">\n        <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">访问量</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0\">12,480</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">↑ 18%</div></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">新用户</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0\">326</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--green)\">↑ 6%</div></div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1;border:1px solid var(--border-light);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">转化率</div><div style=\"font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0\">4.2%</div><div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">↓ 0.8%</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/tabs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">Tabs 标签页模式</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/tabs","markdown":"# 标签页Tabs\n\n你可能会说\n内容太多了，帮我分几个页签，点一下就换一屏。\n\n**标签页是在同一页面内切换平级内容面板的导航组件**·项目详情可在“概览、配置、日志”之间切换。要清楚显示当前标签和是否保留输入状态；本质为不同页面的内容应使用导航菜单。\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 在项目详情中用页签切换“概览、成员、日志”，始终标出当前页签。请保留各页签合理的状态，并验证鼠标、键盘切换以及小屏下不会被裁掉。\n\n### 什么时候用\n\n- 同一页面切换**几组平级内容**：全部 / 进行中 / 已完成\n\n全部待付款已完成\n- **详情页内容分块**：概览、配置、日志，不用来回跳页\n\n概览配置日志\n- 平级内容较少，且用户会频繁来回查看\n\n评论历史收藏\n不用跳转，点一下就换内容\n- 标签文案**简短直接**，便于快速扫读\n\n全部进行完成\n\n### 什么时候不用\n\n- 内容有明确先后顺序时，使用 [步骤条 **Steps**](/vibe-hub/steps?lang=zh) 更合适\n\n1填写信息2确认订单3完成支付\n- 标签过多且无法在可用宽度内清楚显示时，应改用 [导航菜单 **Menu**](/vibe-hub/menu?lang=zh) 或 [选择器 **Select**](/vibe-hub/select?lang=zh)\n\n全部前端后端设计运营产品测试数据\n放不下的标签会被挤没\n- 两组内容需要**左右对照** → 并排展示，别藏进标签\n\n左右分栏，两边同时对照\n- 标签里放着**未保存的表单**，一切换内容就丢\n\n基本信息高级设置\n还没保存的内容…切走标签，填的内容没了\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n全部进行中已完成进行中的 6 个项目…\n\n1标签页Tabs整组标签 + 面板的容器\n\n2标签项Tab可点击切换，文案要短\n\n3当前标签Active Tab高亮 + 下划线，告诉用户现在在哪\n\n4内容面板Tab Panel当前标签对应的内容区\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n线条型Line\n\n全部进行中已完成\n\n全部 24 个项目\n\n默认款，下划线轻，不抢内容风头\n\n卡片型Card\n\n全部进行中已完成\n\n想让标签分组感更强、更像独立区块\n\n胶囊型Capsule\n\n全部进行中已完成\n\n放在工具栏等小空间，更轻巧\n\n典型使用场景\n\n列表状态筛选\n\n全部 24进行中 6已完成 18\n\n      \n官网首页改版进行中\n\n      \n设计规范文档已完成\n\n      \n移动端适配未开始\n\n设置页分块\n\n设置\n\n      \n账号通知隐私\n\n      \n林小hu更换头像\n\n      \n绑定邮箱you@example.com\n\n详情页 概览 / 配置 / 日志\n\n**vibe-ui-guide**运行中\n\n      \n概览配置日志\n\n      \n14:32:05 build completed in 3.2s\n\n        \n14:32:06 deploying to production…\n\n        \n14:32:09 ✓ deploy success\n\n仪表盘视角切换\n\n本周本月本季度\n\n      \n访问量\n\n12,480\n\n↑ 18%\n\n        \n新用户\n\n326\n\n↑ 6%\n\n        \n转化率\n\n4.2%\n\n↓ 0.8%\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[Tabs 标签页模式WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/tabs/)"}